  "instagram_caption": "Wibbo found a mystery egg! Is it a cookie? A red car? No, Wibbo!\n\nIt's a baby sea turtle! Sea turtle eggs stay in the warm sand for about 60 days. Then the babies hatch together and rush to the sea, with the moon on the water showing the way.\n\nSilly Wibbo. Smart kids.\n\nWhat would YOU name a baby sea turtle?\n\n#wibbo #kidslearning #guessinggame #funnykids #seaturtle",
  "youtube_title": "What's Inside the Mystery Egg? A Turtle? No, Wibbo!",
  "youtube_description": "Wibbo finds a mystery egg and guesses a cookie, then a red car. Count down with us to find out what's really inside! Sea turtle eggs stay in the warm sand for about 60 days, then the babies rush to the sea together.\n\nSources:\n• NOAA National Ocean Service, \"How do sea turtles hatch?\" (fetched Nov 20, 2026)\n\nWibbo: silly Wibbo, smart kids. Instagram: @hellowibbo\n\n#Wibbo #SeaTurtle #Shorts",
